# The sdist ships tests/, and tests/test_example_node.py imports from examples/
# — so examples/ has to travel with it or `pytest` on an unpacked sdist fails.
# docs/ goes along too, since the README links to it.
#
# Deliberately NOT included: any repo-local working material (see the second
# half of .gitignore). setuptools excludes it by default, and this comment
# exists so nobody adds a blanket `graft .` here later.
recursive-include examples *.py
recursive-include docs *.md
include CHANGELOG.md CONTRIBUTING.md
